WEBVTT

00:01.394 --> 00:03.694
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:03.834 --> 00:06.854
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:07.374 --> 00:10.104
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:10.104 --> 00:14.734
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:15.174 --> 00:22.144
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:23.884 --> 00:26.754
Dragon Drive

00:26.754 --> 00:32.254
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:32.394 --> 00:35.364
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:35.364 --> 00:38.594
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:39.104 --> 00:43.474
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:43.474 --> 00:45.444
ima mo
I'd still...

00:45.444 --> 00:51.744
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:53.484 --> 00:55.854
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:55.854 --> 00:59.044
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

00:59.384 --> 01:04.394
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:04.394 --> 01:05.954
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:06.094 --> 01:08.494
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:08.494 --> 01:11.624
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:12.034 --> 01:17.104
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:17.104 --> 01:19.844
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:19.844 --> 01:27.514
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:41.334 --> 01:43.854
This'll teach you that there's always
someone stronger waiting for you!

01:46.164 --> 01:47.964
You just don't get it!

01:48.474 --> 01:50.094
I'm number one!

01:50.374 --> 01:51.934
Anytime! And anywhere!

01:52.304 --> 01:54.434
I'm sure of it! I feel it!

01:54.574 --> 01:55.974
I can't turn back now!

01:57.214 --> 01:58.404
O-Oh, no!!

01:58.784 --> 02:00.904
You can either beat me
to earn the right to fight SinnSaber...

02:01.254 --> 02:05.084
...or fall to your knees before me.
It's one or the other.

02:05.284 --> 02:06.314
Okay.

02:06.754 --> 02:08.344
I'll fight against you!

02:10.324 --> 02:13.354
SinnSaber

02:32.814 --> 02:35.304
I've been waiting for this moment!

02:38.124 --> 02:40.614
Chibi. You know how strong he is.

02:40.694 --> 02:42.154
Don't let your guard down.

02:46.934 --> 02:49.164
What's wrong? Why aren't you attacking?

02:49.834 --> 02:52.324
You're the one who's
itching to fight against me!

02:52.404 --> 02:56.094
In any case, I'm not some amateur
who's gonna give away my moves!

02:56.804 --> 02:58.064
Then I'm coming at you!

03:36.714 --> 03:37.704
This isn't everything!

03:37.844 --> 03:39.044
What isn't everything?!

03:39.184 --> 03:41.654
This isn't the extent of your abilities!

03:42.014 --> 03:42.784
What?

03:42.854 --> 03:44.374
I'm not blind!

03:46.854 --> 03:48.754
What are you talking about, Hikaru?!

03:48.924 --> 03:51.584
You said you wanted me to fight you,
and now I'm fighting desperately!

03:51.694 --> 03:53.054
Then try dealing with this!

04:04.974 --> 04:05.944
Damn!

04:24.594 --> 04:25.564
I see him!

04:25.894 --> 04:27.364
There!

04:36.674 --> 04:37.604
That's it.

04:37.674 --> 04:39.334
This is more like it, Reiji Ohzora!

04:39.474 --> 04:43.804
This is the true strength
that I sensed in you back then!

04:48.384 --> 04:50.244
This is what I've been waiting for!

05:02.034 --> 05:02.994
What?!

05:24.224 --> 05:26.214
Could that be?

05:26.424 --> 05:27.944
...the legendary dragon...

05:28.024 --> 05:29.614
SinnSaber?!

05:29.854 --> 05:31.624
Chibi! Let's go!

05:31.694 --> 05:33.124
You're in my way! I'll get rid of you!

05:39.764 --> 05:40.734
Hikaru!

05:44.944 --> 05:46.804
Wh-What is this thing?!

05:46.874 --> 05:48.034
Its strength is incredible!

06:18.544 --> 06:19.594
Reiji!

06:20.674 --> 06:23.544
Help, Reiji!

06:23.844 --> 06:25.044
Maiko?!

06:25.184 --> 06:26.144
Stop!

06:27.154 --> 06:29.384
Reiji!!

06:33.084 --> 06:34.714
Maiko!!

06:42.094 --> 06:46.394
- Reiji!!
- Maiko!!

07:01.854 --> 07:02.874
Chibi...

07:08.824 --> 07:10.414
SinnSaber?

07:19.734 --> 07:21.264
Ch-Chibi!

07:21.934 --> 07:27.104
Chibi!!

07:33.214 --> 07:35.614
I-It was only a dream.

07:42.294 --> 07:44.624
SinnSaber defeated Chibi...

07:47.394 --> 07:49.724
We fell from way up there?

07:51.704 --> 07:53.994
I'm hungry.

07:56.334 --> 07:57.934
Hikaru! You!

07:58.004 --> 07:58.974
What?

07:59.074 --> 08:00.334
What do you mean "What?"

08:00.414 --> 08:02.134
Why aren't you sharing?!

08:02.674 --> 08:03.774
There's none left.

08:03.844 --> 08:04.814
What?!

08:04.884 --> 08:08.244
You could've left me some! Bastard!

08:08.484 --> 08:09.644
- Hm?
- Hey! Listen to me!

08:09.714 --> 08:11.714
I see you're awake.

08:13.684 --> 08:14.714
That old man!

08:15.554 --> 08:17.114
How are you feeling?

08:17.194 --> 08:19.354
My head hurts and I'm very hungry.

08:19.494 --> 08:20.464
I see.

08:20.534 --> 08:23.764
If you can tell that you're hungry,
your head's all right.

08:24.264 --> 08:25.234
Want some?

08:25.304 --> 08:26.924
Yeah, I'll have some.

08:28.334 --> 08:30.774
Did this old man save us?

08:30.974 --> 08:31.944
Yeah.

08:32.244 --> 08:34.574
But my name is Koumei.

08:34.644 --> 08:35.944
Not "old man".

08:37.914 --> 08:39.004
This is great.

08:39.084 --> 08:40.874
Is it? Then have all you want.

08:41.414 --> 08:46.184
Actually, there's a reason
for me feeding you like this.

08:46.624 --> 08:47.714
A reason?

08:47.894 --> 08:49.354
I need your help.

08:49.654 --> 08:50.624
Huh?

08:52.194 --> 08:56.024
I observed your abilities
as you were being attacked by SinnSaber.

08:56.494 --> 08:57.264
What?

08:57.334 --> 08:59.464
You were beaten up pretty soundly...

08:59.864 --> 09:01.534
We haven't lost the battle yet!

09:01.604 --> 09:02.864
We were just caught off guard!

09:02.934 --> 09:03.924
Right, Hikaru?

09:05.774 --> 09:08.404
You won't even admit that you lost!

09:08.474 --> 09:10.534
That shows a lot of confidence!

09:12.284 --> 09:16.214
The fact that you're still hungry
even after being beaten up by SinnSaber...

09:16.284 --> 09:18.044
...is proof that you have great power.

09:18.154 --> 09:21.244
I've been searching for such dragon masters.

09:21.894 --> 09:23.514
What do you want us to do?

09:24.964 --> 09:26.514
Get rid of some bandits.

09:26.864 --> 09:28.454
B-Bandits?

09:29.434 --> 09:33.494
I want you to beat up a gang of bandits
and bring back my daughter for me.

09:33.874 --> 09:35.894
D-Daughter?

10:00.264 --> 10:03.494
Ichirou's really showing off.

10:04.164 --> 10:07.494
Maybe I should be like him,
and just tell Maiko how I feel.

10:11.344 --> 10:13.744
Hey! My sweet honey!

10:15.274 --> 10:16.574
She's alone.

10:16.974 --> 10:19.844
G-Good! This is my chance!

10:25.624 --> 10:29.214
Where have you gone, Reiji?

10:29.624 --> 10:31.284
Please hurry back.

10:35.094 --> 10:38.294
Daisuke Hagiwara, you're on your way
to the biggest moment of your life.

10:39.064 --> 10:41.194
Here I go!

10:42.374 --> 10:43.334
What's wrong?

10:45.144 --> 10:46.264
Elder.

10:46.544 --> 10:48.874
You're worried about Reiji
because he hasn't returned, aren't you?

10:49.014 --> 10:49.974
What?

10:50.244 --> 10:51.734
I don't really care...

10:51.914 --> 10:54.434
Huh? Is this about Reiji?

10:54.814 --> 10:56.644
I don't care about Reiji.

10:56.714 --> 10:58.774
Of course, just as I thought.

10:59.554 --> 11:00.684
You don't have to hide it.

11:00.754 --> 11:02.454
It's written all over your face.

11:02.654 --> 11:03.684
Are you worried?

11:03.754 --> 11:05.224
Wh-What?

11:05.424 --> 11:06.984
Me, worried?

11:07.264 --> 11:09.524
Reiji's always dashing out
like a bullet from a rifle.

11:09.664 --> 11:12.324
Worrying about a guy like him
would only wear me out.

11:13.634 --> 11:15.264
There's no need to worry.

11:15.534 --> 11:16.834
Reiji's fine.

11:16.974 --> 11:19.034
Huh?! Really?! What a relief!

11:19.604 --> 11:21.874
Which is it?!

11:23.374 --> 11:24.344
Daisuke?

11:24.414 --> 11:25.774
What are you doing here?

11:25.984 --> 11:27.674
Huh? I, I...

11:27.754 --> 11:28.714
Look!

11:41.294 --> 11:42.194
Why, it's!

11:42.264 --> 11:44.194
Mr. Taiyou and Ichirou!

11:44.304 --> 11:45.264
They're fighting!

11:52.644 --> 11:53.504
Rockaku!

11:53.574 --> 11:54.874
Why are they fighting?!

11:56.674 --> 11:58.304
Hey! Will you guys stop it?!

11:58.384 --> 12:00.144
Okay! Kanper!

12:02.614 --> 12:04.274
I'll go and stop them!

12:08.554 --> 12:10.784
Elder. There you are.

12:10.894 --> 12:11.954
Oh, Meguru.

12:12.024 --> 12:13.994
Those fools are fighting! We must...

12:14.634 --> 12:15.654
No, they're not.

12:15.994 --> 12:18.364
They're not? What do you mean?

12:18.634 --> 12:20.654
They're not fighting against each other.

12:21.234 --> 12:22.164
You're certain?

12:22.834 --> 12:24.634
Hey, guys! Stop it!

12:24.704 --> 12:26.474
What good will fighting each other do?!

12:26.674 --> 12:28.074
What fight?!

12:28.344 --> 12:30.334
This is not a fight!

12:30.414 --> 12:31.174
Right!

12:31.244 --> 12:33.474
That would be a pointless waste of energy!

12:33.844 --> 12:36.214
We're training for our battle!

12:36.614 --> 12:37.314
Huh?

12:37.784 --> 12:40.314
Daisuke! Won't you join us?!

12:42.754 --> 12:44.454
Wh-What did you do that for?!

12:44.524 --> 12:46.554
If Reiji is the only one who gets stronger...

12:46.624 --> 12:49.924
...there's no saying whether or not
we can win against that brat, Kouhei!

12:50.494 --> 12:52.994
So we've decided to train, as you can see!

12:55.404 --> 12:57.034
This is training?!

12:58.244 --> 13:00.574
Kanper! Counterattack!

13:04.444 --> 13:06.474
I'll join you too!

13:07.784 --> 13:09.444
If only Jigen Joker were awakened...

13:09.684 --> 13:12.014
...then I could be of some help.

13:12.554 --> 13:15.494
Jigen Joker has its own role in all of this.

13:15.954 --> 13:18.924
The time will come
when you'll discover that, Meguru.

13:24.564 --> 13:25.724
So that's it.

13:26.034 --> 13:27.004
Reika.

13:27.264 --> 13:28.894
W-W-Wait!

13:28.974 --> 13:30.464
Where do you think you're going?

13:30.844 --> 13:32.674
Reika's there!

13:32.774 --> 13:34.244
Who's Reika?

13:34.574 --> 13:36.704
My daughter. They have her!

13:37.374 --> 13:38.844
I understand how you feel...

13:38.914 --> 13:40.644
...but we should have some sort of plan first.

13:40.754 --> 13:42.374
How many bandits are there?

13:42.654 --> 13:43.984
About ten.

13:44.324 --> 13:48.884
Every year, come harvest time,
they attack the townspeople...

13:49.194 --> 13:52.164
...and loot our village.

13:56.594 --> 14:01.264
And now they've taken my daughter, Reika,
the most beautiful girl in the village!

14:03.004 --> 14:04.524
Help me!

14:07.404 --> 14:09.004
The most beautiful in the village...

14:09.074 --> 14:10.904
Is that what you're after?

14:12.614 --> 14:13.914
N-No way!

14:14.014 --> 14:17.644
I'm gonna save Mr. Koumei's daughter
to repay him for saving us.

14:17.754 --> 14:20.014
Huh, you're just as suspicious.

14:20.184 --> 14:23.354
You always look calm, but inside that head,
I'll bet you're thinking perverted thoughts.

14:23.524 --> 14:25.894
I just don't want you running away from me.

14:27.424 --> 14:28.584
You're still obsessed with that?

14:28.994 --> 14:30.624
Until we finish our battle, yes.

14:32.034 --> 14:32.964
You're the kind of guy...

14:33.034 --> 14:36.304
...who keeps calling old girlfriends
after they've dumped you, aren't you?

14:39.044 --> 14:40.004
Chibi.

14:40.404 --> 14:42.204
Huh? Where'd Mr. Koumei go?

14:44.414 --> 14:46.044
He's way over there!

14:49.884 --> 14:51.714
What is it, old man?!

14:52.554 --> 14:55.494
Give me back my daughter, Reika!

14:56.024 --> 14:58.394
You're from that village
we attacked the other day.

14:58.464 --> 15:00.954
You've got some guts,
coming after us alone!

15:02.534 --> 15:03.864
Return my daughter!

15:03.934 --> 15:05.364
Where's Reika?!

15:05.734 --> 15:07.794
What do you mean, "return my daughter"?!

15:08.104 --> 15:09.504
You must be dreaming!

15:10.074 --> 15:11.364
Stop it!

15:12.474 --> 15:14.634
Let go of that old man!

15:15.014 --> 15:16.234
What is it now?!

15:16.444 --> 15:19.474
We're fighters for justice,
here to beat you guys up!

15:20.214 --> 15:22.184
You're gonna beat us up?

15:23.084 --> 15:25.554
That's pretty funny, kid.

15:25.924 --> 15:28.114
Release Mr. Koumei's daughter!

15:28.224 --> 15:30.244
Otherwise, you're gonna regret it!

15:31.924 --> 15:34.694
Really? In what way?

15:40.604 --> 15:43.264
I see. That's quite a dragon.

15:43.404 --> 15:45.604
But do you realize where you are?

15:45.704 --> 15:48.374
There's a legendary dragon called SinnSaber
living in this mountain, and...

15:48.444 --> 15:51.174
That's why you think
you're safe here?

15:51.384 --> 15:53.374
We already know that!

15:53.514 --> 15:55.274
Then that saves me some explaining...

15:55.384 --> 15:58.514
...but if we make our dragons fight here...

15:58.584 --> 16:01.524
...they'll wake SinnSaber,
who's sleeping atop the mountain...

16:01.594 --> 16:03.354
...and cause it to go wild!

16:04.124 --> 16:07.114
So now that you know,
why don't you hurry on home!

16:07.224 --> 16:08.194
You're sure?!

16:08.534 --> 16:10.794
You're sure that SinnSaber will come here?!

16:11.534 --> 16:13.554
Yeah. It's true.

16:13.734 --> 16:15.534
Great! Let's do it, Chibi!

16:27.684 --> 16:28.654
What?!

16:28.754 --> 16:29.714
B-Boss!

16:29.854 --> 16:31.874
Th-These guys are crazy!

16:32.254 --> 16:33.914
We have no choice... Trio! Get 'em!

16:34.224 --> 16:35.244
B-But Boss!

16:35.324 --> 16:37.584
If we do that, SinnSaber will!

16:37.664 --> 16:40.424
While Trio fights, we'll get out of here!
Start packing our loot!

16:40.794 --> 16:41.554
Hikaru!

16:41.634 --> 16:44.864
I'll go and look for Mr. Koumei's daughter.
You look after things here!

16:45.334 --> 16:46.824
Fine, as long as you don't run away.

16:46.904 --> 16:48.164
Why would I run away?!

16:48.904 --> 16:50.164
Let's go, Chibi!

17:05.224 --> 17:06.774
Where's Reika?!

17:07.154 --> 17:09.054
That way! That way! That way!

17:16.734 --> 17:19.534
C-Could that be... Reika?

17:25.244 --> 17:26.204
Disappointing.

17:26.444 --> 17:28.504
I thought they would put up more of a fight.

17:32.314 --> 17:33.334
Reika?!

17:33.414 --> 17:35.214
Reika!!

17:37.254 --> 17:39.844
Oh, Reika!

17:40.124 --> 17:42.314
Mr. Koumei, I'm glad you're pleased.

17:42.424 --> 17:44.754
Yeah! Thank you!

18:02.074 --> 18:03.234
SinnSaber!

18:03.744 --> 18:05.804
Hikaru! I'll fight it!

19:01.174 --> 19:02.134
Hikaru?

19:04.444 --> 19:05.634
SinnSaber!

19:05.704 --> 19:07.294
I'm the one who will defeat you!

19:10.544 --> 19:14.574
In order to save this world, Rikyu,
and our world, Earth!

19:14.654 --> 19:16.204
...Chibi and I must defeat Kouhei!

19:19.284 --> 19:22.224
And unless I beat you,
I'll never beat Kouhei!

19:22.724 --> 19:26.184
So I must defeat you, no matter what!

19:50.484 --> 19:51.644
Reiji...

19:52.824 --> 19:54.014
Reiji.

20:16.874 --> 20:19.974
Chibi... wh-what happened?

20:20.684 --> 20:22.204
Did we win?

20:26.824 --> 20:28.584
What's that, Chibi?

20:34.734 --> 20:36.724
Chibi?! What's the matter?!

21:02.424 --> 21:04.944
I-Incredible!

21:29.514 --> 21:30.954
Here we are again.

21:31.724 --> 21:35.854
Now, let's get to it
and finish this game.

21:56.074 --> 21:58.814
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:58.814 --> 22:01.584
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:01.584 --> 22:05.514
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:06.984 --> 22:09.754
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:09.754 --> 22:11.914
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:12.394 --> 22:16.494
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:17.934 --> 22:20.604
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:20.604 --> 22:23.334
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:23.334 --> 22:27.294
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:28.644 --> 22:31.144
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:31.144 --> 22:34.144
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:34.144 --> 22:39.014
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:39.684 --> 22:42.424
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:42.424 --> 22:45.194
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:45.194 --> 22:49.824
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:50.564 --> 22:53.334
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:53.334 --> 22:56.004
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:56.004 --> 23:00.634
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:01.314 --> 23:05.804
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:06.744 --> 23:12.414
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:14.824 --> 23:17.344
Next time

23:17.894 --> 23:18.824
We did it!

23:18.894 --> 23:20.654
We got SinnSaber's powers!

23:20.724 --> 23:23.564
With this, we can take on
those guys from RI-ON!

23:24.534 --> 23:26.794
Huh? Chibi's acting a bit strange again.

23:27.164 --> 23:29.504
What?! The curse of SinnSaber?!

23:30.474 --> 23:32.734
And as if that's not enough,
Kouhei's returned to Rikyu!

23:32.804 --> 23:35.364
And Maiko and Daisuke are in trouble!

23:35.774 --> 23:38.574
Next, on Dragon Drive, "The Price of Power".

23:38.744 --> 23:41.684
Plus, a mysterious new character
makes his appearance!

23:41.684 --> 23:42.554
The Price of Power
Plus, a mysterious new character
makes his appearance!

23:42.554 --> 23:42.584
The Price of Power

23:42.584 --> 23:44.444
The Price of Power
Who are you?
